      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a doc for our new CI/CD pipeline. can u give me a quick breakdown of the main stages—code commit, automated testing, staging, and production—and specifically what kind of gates or checks we should have at each step to make sure nothing breaks?",
